<title>USA: Peru rebels agree to negotiating commission - CNN.</title>
<headline>Peru rebels agree to negotiating commission - CNN.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marxist rebels holding 74 hostages have accepted a Peruvian government proposal that a commission oversee negotiations to end the stand-off, CNN said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a radio transmission picked up by CNN, the rebels said they accepted the idea of a commission with representatives from the Red Cross, the Vatican, the Guatemalan government and from a European country.</p>
</text>
